  "description": "<p>Discover Rothco&rsquo;s Long Length Camo BDU Shorts, designed with a longer inseam and wider leg opening for enhanced comfort and coverage. Crafted from a durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these shorts offer high-capacity storage and a customizable fit. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
